From dec0a44338cdc2cf1992cc6680aa772c6d4540e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 09:06:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 431/638] [AROS] Retire AROS renderer bitmap trace

Remove renderer and Viz frame/bitmap fingerprint probes now that shared software bitmap handoff is established. Preserve the diagnostic checkpoint in history and retain normal frame submission behavior.

---
 .../async_layer_tree_frame_sink.cc            | 29 ------
 .../compositor_frame_sink_support.cc          | 94 +------------------
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 122 deletions(-)

